     A* ORDRCV    Goods received from suppliers        (CASE-040)
     A* DDS physical file. Numeric data is NOT checked when records
     A* are written, so CPYF FMTOPT(*NOCHK) can load invalid packed
     A* data into RCVQTY and RCVCOST.
     A* Create: CRTPF FILE(ORDLAB/ORDRCV) SRCFILE(ORDLAB/QDDSSRC)
     A* Status: written, NOT yet compiled or executed on IBM i.
     A          R ORDRCVR                   TEXT('Goods received')
     A            RCVITEM       10A         TEXT('Item number')
     A            RCVQTY         7P 0       TEXT('Quantity received')
     A            RCVCOST        9P 2       TEXT('Unit cost')
